{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"mutating","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reserveCapacity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"minimumCapacity","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Int","text":"Int","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The requested number of elements to store."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"name":"minimumCapacity"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","text":"Discussion","type":"heading","level":2},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you are adding a known number of elements to an array, use this method","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to avoid multiple reallocations. This method ensures that the array has","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"unique, mutable, contiguous storage, with space allocated for at least","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"the requested number of elements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Calling the ","type":"text"},{"code":"reserveCapacity(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method on an array with bridged storage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"triggers a copy to contiguous storage even if the existing storage","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"has room to store ","type":"text"},{"code":"minimumCapacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" elements.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"For performance reasons, the size of the newly allocated storage might be","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"greater than the requested capacity. Use the array’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"capacity","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" property","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to determine the size of the new storage.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"anchor":"Preserving-an-Arrays-Geometric-Growth-Strategy","text":"Preserving an Array’s Geometric Growth Strategy","type":"heading","level":1},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"If you implement a custom data structure backed by an array that grows","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"dynamically, naively calling the ","type":"text"},{"code":"reserveCapacity(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" method can lead","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"to worse than expected performance. Arrays need to follow a geometric","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"allocation pattern for appending elements to achieve amortized","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"constant-time performance. The ","type":"text"},{"code":"Array","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" type’s ","type":"text"},{"code":"append(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"append(contentsOf:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" methods take care of this detail for you, but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"reserveCapacity(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" allocates only as much space as you tell it to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"(padded to a round value), and no more. This avoids over-allocation, but","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"can result in insertion not having amortized constant-time performance.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The following code declares ","type":"text"},{"code":"values","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", an array of integers, and the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"addTenQuadratic()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" function, which adds ten more values to the ","type":"text"},{"code":"values","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"array on each call.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  var values: [Int] = [0, 1, 2, 3]","","  \/\/ Don't use 'reserveCapacity(_:)' like this","  func addTenQuadratic() {","      let newCount = values.count + 10","      values.reserveCapacity(newCount)","      for n in values.count..<newCount {","          values.append(n)","      }","  }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The call to ","type":"text"},{"code":"reserveCapacity(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" increases the ","type":"text"},{"code":"values","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" array’s capacity","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"by exactly 10 elements on each pass through ","type":"text"},{"code":"addTenQuadratic()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", which","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is linear growth. Instead of having constant time when averaged over","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"many calls, the function may decay to performance that is linear in","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"values.count","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". This is almost certainly not what you want.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"In cases like this, the simplest fix is often to simply remove the call"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reserveCapacity(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":", and let the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"append(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" method grow the array"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"for you."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["  func addTen() {","      let newCount = values.count + 10","      for n in values.count..<newCount {","          values.append(n)","      }","  }"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"If you need more control over the capacity of your array, implement your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"own geometric growth strategy, passing the size you compute to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"reserveCapacity(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"O(","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":"), where ","type":"text"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"n"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"text":" is the number of elements in the array.","type":"text"}]}],"style":"note","name":"Complexity","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Reserves enough space to store the specified number of elements.","type":"text"}],"metadata":{"platforms":[{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"iOS"},{"deprecated":false,"beta":false,"unavailable":false,"introducedAt":"8.0","name":"iPadOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"13.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"Mac Catalyst"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"10.10","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"macOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"9.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"tvOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"1.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"visionOS"},{"deprecated":false,"introducedAt":"2.0","unavailable":false,"beta":false,"name":"watchOS"}],"role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","title":"reserveCapacity(_:)","externalID":"s:s10ArraySliceV15reserveCapacityyySiF","modules":[{"name":"Swift"}],"extendedModule":"Swift","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reserveCapacity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"symbolKind":"method"},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ArraySlice\/reserveCapacity(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ArraySlice"]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/swift\/arrayslice\/reservecapacity(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift":{"role":"collection","abstract":[{"text":"Build apps using a powerful open language.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift","title":"Swift","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift","type":"topic","kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/ArraySlice":{"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/arrayslice","title":"ArraySlice","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"ArraySlice"}],"abstract":[{"text":"A slice of an ","type":"text"},{"code":"Array","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", ","type":"text"},{"code":"ContiguousArray","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", or ","type":"text"},{"code":"ArraySlice","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" instance.","type":"text"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"ArraySlice"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ArraySlice","role":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/Int":{"role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A signed integer value type."}],"url":"\/documentation\/swift\/int","title":"Int","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Int","kind":"identifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/Int","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://com.apple.Swift/documentation/Swift/ArraySlice/reserveCapacity(_:)":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"text":"Reserves enough space to store the specified number of elements.","type":"text"}],"role":"symbol","title":"reserveCapacity(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"reserveCapacity","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Si","text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.apple.Swift\/documentation\/Swift\/ArraySlice\/reserveCapacity(_:)","url":"\/documentation\/swift\/arrayslice\/reservecapacity(_:)"}}}